From: blester <blester@oreon>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] TST: numexpr 2.13+ supports bool +/*

numexpr >= 2.13.1 does bool arith itself so pandas does not warn on fallback.

--- a/pandas/tests/test_expressions.py	2025-09-29 15:12:09.000000000 -0700
